&lt;p&gt;Are you a driven back-end developer who doesn't wait for instructions, but is already thinking two steps ahead? Who experiments with new technologies and smart solutions alongside the job? Then we want to talk to you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Straight forward but clear: Twikey isn't looking for someone to just execute. We're looking for someone who thinks, does and keeps going when the going gets tough.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Because fintech is evolving at breakneck speed. That calls for real ownership and for someone who can dive deep on the technical side to keep innovating and improving our platform. You get plenty in return, such as the freedom and responsibility to deliver your own projects. Thanks in part to our organisational structure, you can shape your ideas in the short term and see the results of your hard work quickly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Driven by your passion for building scalable, performant and secure back-end systems, you continuously raise the bar for your own skills and for our product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a member of our development team you work closely with our CTO, 3 fellow developers and 2 testers on the core of our software application. A small, strong team in which you take on a role with real impact on the future of our product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You focus on&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;developing and improving the back-end&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;of our platform, optimising the architecture and data processing while keeping the security and stability of our system in mind. This lets you put your technical skills to full use and come up with innovative solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;With your expertise you'll&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;make valuable suggestions and streamline processes&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for all our stakeholders, so we can work more efficiently and achieve better results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You provide&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;technical support on integration projects&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;with software houses, banks and large companies, solving complex technical problems. That gives you the chance to work on challenging projects and to get in touch with a wide range of technologies and industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Once you know our product inside out, there are plenty of challenging projects for you to help build.&lt;/p&gt;
