&lt;li&gt;You are&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;driven, curious and enterprising.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Not only in your job, but outside of it too. You have a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;pro-active attitude&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and are always a few steps ahead: you spot opportunities, grab them and get to work.&lt;/li&gt;
