&lt;li&gt;Design and maintain secure external data flows through SFTP, Files.com, and APIs, with a focus on reliability and compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate manual reporting and operational tasks, building robust, reusable pipeline components that reduce operational overhead&lt;/li&gt;
