&lt;li&gt;Oversee risk assessments for consumer banking products, identifying potential areas of risk and working cross-functionally to manage such risks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the Fair Lending Officer overseeing the company’s fair lending program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure proper oversight of vendors and other third parties that present potential compliance or regulatory risk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee remediation plans for high priority issues to ensure timely

