&lt;li&gt;Reporting into the VP of Partnerships APJ, you will manage and support target partners across all Partner tiers helping to manage our partners across Australia and New Zealand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the sales team across Australia and New Zealand to support their regional GTM requirements
