&lt;li&gt;Help partners with deal registrations, portal access, program benefits etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to tracking partner performance against agreed-upon metrics, such as revenue targets and pipeline development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster collaborative relationships with partners through ongoing engagement, communication, and business reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the execution of marketing and demand generation activities with partners to drive brand awareness and lead generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the promotion and engagement with the Ping Partner program and related tools and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in coordinating and participating in joint business planning activities with partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal teams to ensure effective communication and coordination with partners.&lt;/li&gt;
