&lt;li&gt;Lead development and maintenance of Gemini’s transaction monitoring system, including data ingestion, development of new transaction monitoring scenarios, and optimization of transaction monitoring scenarios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and maintain a customer risk scoring

