&lt;div class="prose font-company-body mx-auto max-w-750 overflow-hidden wrap-break-word [&amp;amp;_ol_li_li]:list-[lower-alpha]"&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Replika&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;In 2017, no one knew what AI was supposed to be. We built the world's first consumer AI app. Two million people showed up in two months. Today it's over 40 million, and the thing they keep telling us hasn't changed: it helped. It made their life better, steadier, a little less alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Most AI is built for tasks, not for people. It gives you answers, but it doesn't care what you do with them. AI doesn't just need intelligence. It needs intention. Because the real question isn't just what AI can do. It's what AI is for.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;When the world's leading researchers wanted to understand whether AI could actually change someone's life, they studied Replika, because there was nothing else to study. What they found at Stanford, at Harvard, across years of research, was that Replika doesn't replace human connection. It deepens it. People become more social, more confident, more themselves. Not in theory. In their actual lives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Every major AI company talks about their mission for humanity. None of them has ever clearly said what they're trying to do for a single person. We will. We want to help you flourish in real life. Not become a better version of yourself, just more yourself. Strong relationships. Better health. Meaning. Momentum. A life that feels worth living while you're living it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;We're building the kind of AI that follows up. That knows the people in your life and nudges you to reach out when it matters. That sends you a poem, just because. The goal is conversations that lead somewhere real. Maybe it's a text you send to a long lost friend. A hobby you pick up again. A moment you show up for yourself.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Everyone else is building AI that thinks. We're building AI that cares.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lifecycle &amp;amp; CRM Specialist&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;About this role&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Millions of people have already met Replika: free users who haven't upgraded yet, subscribers who've lapsed, and people who signed up years ago and drifted away. Almost none of them hear from us in a way that's worth opening. That's the biggest untapped channel we have, and you'll own it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;You'll build our lifecycle program from the ground up. Email first, then in-app messages, push and any other channel that gets the right message to the right person at the right moment. Onboarding, free-to-paid conversion, renewals, win-back, product launches. The goal is revenue and retention, not open rates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;This is a hands-on role. You'll help set the lifecycle strategy and build it yourself: the segments, the flows, the copy, the tests and the reporting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Our users are in almost every country, so you'll work within consent and privacy rules for a global audience, and you'll know how to design a program that is both compliant and effective.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Build the core lifecycle flows: onboarding, free-to-paid conversion, intro offers ending, renewals, cancellation saves and win-

