&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Brand Ad Formats team drives the development of ad formats that help advertisers maximize reach and brand impact. They focus on high-visibility, awareness-driven solutions that create memorable experiences for Reddit users. By delivering guaranteed placements and engaging ad interactions, they support major brand initiatives and help advertisers achieve measurable outcomes.&amp;nbsp; The team is building fully customizable interactive formats and AI-driven ads that incorporate User-Generated Content (UGC).&amp;nbsp; Moving forward, we will be doubling down on Video Ads, with the goal of turning Reddit into an industry leader and a ‘must buy’ for advertisers to promote video content.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Brand Ad Formats team is seeking a skilled Frontend engineer with a product-focused mindset to join the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build Ad experiences and create patterns for Reddit’s web app that enhance our ads’ performance and functionality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate across product, design, and engineering teams to innovate and implement sophisticated solutions for complex challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage in the full development cycle: design, develop, QA, experiment, analyze, and deploy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in Web Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Typescript and Javascript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A willingness to tackle the challenges of creating data-intensive, highly responsive, and fault-tolerant apps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with automated testing best practices, code quality / design patterns, observability, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at performing insightful code reviews, and receiving feedback themself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leveraging GenAI tools to increase software engineering productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills: able to collaborate with teams in a fully remote environment, and discuss complex topics with technical and non-technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on ad tech&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on consumer facing sites (high production value at scale)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technologies used on the team include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Languages: Typescript, HTML, CSS, Go&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frameworks: React, Thrift, gRPC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tools: Kubernetes, Docker, Codex, Cursor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class

