&lt;li&gt;Maintain consistent judgments across lengthy tasks and multiple documents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incorporate feedback and participate in calibration exercises to align with project standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flag unclear guidelines and recommend improvements to rubrics, SOPs, or review instructions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage assignments independently and meet agreed quality and delivery expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

